<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transport Delhi to Patna | Express Container Carrier
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does it typically take to transport a car from Delhi to Patna?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The average transit time for a car shipped from Delhi to Patna is 2 to 3 business days, depending on traffic conditions along NH 19 and weather. Our GPS‑enabled fleet provides real‑time updates, allowing customers to monitor progress and anticipate arrival within the promised window.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures ensure my vehicle arrives without scratches or dents?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We employ a zero‑scratch guarantee that includes hydraulic ramp loading, 4‑wheel lock securing, high‑density edge padding, and custom wooden crates for fragile parts. Every vehicle undergoes a joint inspection before loading, and our drivers follow strict handling protocols approved by ISO 9001:2015 standards.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Which documents are required for RTO clearance when moving a car between Delhi and Patna?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Required paperwork includes the original registration certificate, valid insurance copy, a signed joint inspection report, the e‑Way bill generated for the shipment, and a No‑Objection Certificate (NOC) from the originating RTO. Our team assists in preparing and submitting these documents to ensure smooth inter‑state transfer.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the cost for car transport calculated and what factors influence the price?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing is based on the vehicle’s size and weight, distance (≈1127 km), fuel surcharge, insurance premium, and any additional services such as door‑to‑door pickup or special handling for luxury cars. Seasonal demand and toll variations may also affect the final quote, which is transparently presented in our cost matrix.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my vehicle in real time during the journey?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every carrier in our fleet is equipped with satellite GPS that feeds live location data to our customer portal. Once the vehicle is loaded, you receive a tracking link that shows real‑time progress, estimated arrival time, and any route deviations, ensuring full visibility from Delhi to Patna.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance included in the car transport service?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">All shipments are covered by an IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance that protects the declared value of your vehicle against loss or damage. The insurance premium is included in the quoted price, and a detailed policy document is provided before loading, giving you peace of mind throughout the move.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How do I obtain an online quote for my car transport from Delhi to Patna?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Visit our website and click the ‘Get Quote’ button. Enter your vehicle make, model, dimensions, pickup and drop addresses, and preferred moving date. Our system instantly calculates an estimate based on current rates, fuel surcharge, and any special requirements, then emails you the detailed quote.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
